2 CONT
2 CONT PESCE (Girolamo): Passed away Oct. 13, 1952, at Scorze, Venezia, Italy, dearly beloved husband of Ma
2 CONC ria, loved father of Lina, Alfonso, Emidio, Assunta, father-in-law of Luigi Biasin and Gelsomino Tre
2 CONC visan, grandfather of Gabriella Biasin: aged 58 years.
2 CONT R.I.P.
